      "worked": "Adding $\\angle AOC$ and $\\angle BOD$ counts the overlap $\\angle BOC$ twice.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\angle AOC+\\angle BOD&=100^\\circ\\\\\\angle AOD+\\angle BOC&=100^\\circ\\\\80^\\circ+\\angle BOC&=100^\\circ\\\\\\angle BOC&=20^\\circ\\end{align*}$$",
